00:00:47.246 --> 00:00:50.350 align:start size:97% position:3%
I'm the only refueling
station and I do it on my own.

00:00:53.319 --> 00:00:55.521
In order to run a business,
I have to cater to the people

00:00:55.554 --> 00:00:57.490 align:start size:88% position:13%
in the season that
they're roaming around.

00:00:58.424 --> 00:01:00.193
That's summer.

00:01:00.226 --> 00:01:01.894
And in that June,
July, and August,

00:01:01.927 --> 00:01:04.430 align:start size:94% position:6%
