00:01:25.417 --> 00:01:28.721 align:start size:94% position:6%
The older I get,
the slower I get, but the
animals keep getting faster.

00:01:29.889 --> 00:01:32.191
But, I rise to the
challenge every day.

00:01:32.224 --> 00:01:34.427
It's the challenge
that keeps me going.

00:01:34.460 --> 00:01:36.696
Welcome to Kavik,
it's where I live.

00:01:38.964 --> 00:01:41.601 align:start size:88% position:13%
I think what
I'm gonna have to do is
try to get down there.

00:01:41.634 --> 00:01:43.302 align:start size:78% position:22%
Down the road
a little this way.

00:01:43.335 --> 00:01:47.740 align:start size:88% position:13%
