00:31:55.746 --> 00:31:57.214 line:0%
Everything's going
on in the fall time.

00:31:57.247 --> 00:32:00.318 align:start size:88% position:13% line:0%
Winter's coming
soon, moose are rutting,
that's the time to hunt.

00:32:00.351 --> 00:32:02.553 align:start size:81% position:19%
This is really
when it all happens.

00:32:02.953 --> 00:32:04.989 align:start size:84% position:16%
This is the best
time of the year, and
this is when I go out

00:32:05.022 --> 00:32:07.692
and get the biggest animal
that I hunt all year long.

00:32:13.864 --> 00:32:18.102
Okay. I see a couple
of moose, looks like
they're both cows.

00:32:20.437 --> 00:32:24.142 align:start size:97% position:3%
I'm confident with those two
cows right there that there's
a bull not too far away.

00:32:25.242 --> 00:32:27.645
Bulls are a little
more wary though.

00:32:33.851 --> 00:32:36.887 align:start size:75% position:25%
There he is!
That's the bull!

00:32:36.920 --> 00:32:39.991 align:start size:84% position:16%
He's got his
antlers up towards me.

00:32:40.424 --> 00:32:42.860 align:start size:78% position:22%
