That's my only chance.

00:32:55.706 --> 00:32:59.243 align:start size:88% position:13%
You've gotta learn
how the animals behave.

00:32:59.276 --> 00:33:02.713 align:start size:88% position:13%
And as much as
you learn and as much
experience as you have,

00:33:02.746 --> 00:33:06.450
you're still often at a
disadvantage because the
