00:33:10.020 --> 00:33:11.822 align:start size:94% position:6%
These moose are
getting hunted all the time.

00:33:11.855 --> 00:33:15.393 align:start size:84% position:16%
They've evolved to
escape from predators,
and I'm the predator.

00:33:17.728 --> 00:33:20.264 align:start size:84% position:16%
They're completely
adapted to evading me.

00:33:22.466 --> 00:33:25.403 align:start size:94% position:6%
