00:33:33.944 --> 00:33:36.147 align:start size:81% position:19%
That might get
the bull interested.

00:33:36.180 --> 00:33:40.651 align:start size:91% position:9%
He might come out
and try to chase me away.

00:33:46.957 --> 00:33:48.526
This antler works.

00:33:48.559 --> 00:33:51.362
I've caught a lot of
moose with this antler.

00:33:51.395 --> 00:33:56.167 align:start size:91% position:9%
When they get
close enough to see it, it
often draws them right in.

00:33:56.200 --> 00:33:57.435
