00:33:57.468 --> 00:34:01.506 align:start size:84% position:16%
They see this antler,
and they think
I'm another moose.

00:34:04.741 --> 00:34:07.345 align:start size:88% position:13%
I've gotta fake
this moose out, make him
think I'm another moose.

00:34:09.313 --> 00:34:10.981
I hear a bull.

00:34:11.014 --> 00:34:13.918
He's grunting back.
