00:34:14.218 --> 00:34:17.221 align:start size:97% position:3%
This could be a little tricky,
this brush is pretty high.

00:34:17.254 --> 00:34:20.792
He's gonna have to get real
close for me to get a shot.

00:34:22.593 --> 00:34:24.728 align:start size:78% position:22%
I'm gonna walk
this way slightly.

00:34:24.761 --> 00:34:28.199
I wanna get him as close
to the lake as possible.

00:34:33.103 --> 00:34:35.373 align:start size:72% position:28% line:91%
Here he comes.
I see him.

00:34:36.073 --> 00:34:38.810
(antler raking)

00:34:44.181 --> 00:34:45.683 align:start size:78% position:22%
You see him?
He's right there.

