00:42:31.114 --> 00:42:33.884
I'm not gonna go
for a 30-mile trip.

00:42:33.917 --> 00:42:36.119 align:start size:84% position:16%
I'm gonna go
within reason of camp.

00:42:36.152 --> 00:42:38.255 align:start size:88% position:13%
I wanna see the
five miles around camp.

00:42:41.191 --> 00:42:44.695
I'm just getting
to the area where
I think the bear,

00:42:44.728 --> 00:42:47.164 align:start size:81% position:19%
