00:43:04.247 --> 00:43:06.216 align:start size:78% position:22%
Oh, oh.
That's hella fast!

00:43:07.984 --> 00:43:10.921
Turn in. Come on,
get control Susie!

00:43:13.923 --> 00:43:16.126
Ugh, come on!

00:43:19.596 --> 00:43:22.766 align:start size:88% position:13%
I have a big problem.
I'm having troubles now.

00:43:32.942 --> 00:43:34.912
SUE: I got it.

00:43:37.947 --> 00:43:41.251 align:start size:84% position:16%
That was, uh, a
little intense maybe.

00:43:42.085 --> 00:43:43.954
Um, not bad.

00:43:44.688 --> 00:43:48.191 line:0%
Just, I'll have to
work on maybe how I
wanna place the oars

00:43:48.224 --> 00:43:49.893 line:0%
and the seat
and everything.

00:43:49.926 --> 00:43:53.931 align:start size:94% position:6%
When I'm right in the
middle of the faster water,
and I'm doing this,

00:43:54.964 --> 00:43:58.002 align:start size:78% position:22%
uh, it's
really difficult.

00:43:59.903 --> 00:44:03.507 align:start size:88% position:13%
I've seen a few
caribou tracks, there's
another set right there.

00:44:03.540 --> 00:44:06.977 align:start size:84% position:16%
It looks like they
came this way and went
"Yeah, not today."

00:44:07.811 --> 00:44:10.947 align:start size:91% position:9%
And went back. Don't
see any bear prints here,

00:44:10.980 --> 00:44:13.684 align:start size:78% position:22%
but I wanna
get out and check.

00:44:17.754 --> 00:44:19.556
There we go.

00:44:23.126 --> 00:44:26.863 align:start size:84% position:16%
Well, this is kind
of the area that I saw
the caribou tracks.

00:44:26.896 --> 00:44:30.668 align:start size:88% position:13%
And this is the first
place I can pull over,
you've got a wide shelf.

00:44:31.101 --> 00:44:35.039 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's a great spot if
you're a predator to ambush
something and eat dinner.

00:44:37.040 --> 00:44:39.076
I can see some tracks
here and here already.

00:44:40.510 --> 00:44:42.379
Looks like I got some foxies.

00:44:42.412 --> 00:44:45.149
This is very definitely
wolverine right here.

00:44:46.683 --> 00:44:49.519
I'm seeing a lot of
good activity here.

00:44:49.552 --> 00:44:51.855
What it isn't is a bear.

00:44:52.255 --> 00:44:57.094
Everything here wants to
survive and it's a tough
environment to do it in.

00:44:58.361 --> 00:45:00.330 align:start size:84% position:16%
And this right
here just says it all.

00:45:00.363 --> 00:45:04.334
You've got the fox looking,
you've got the wolverine
looking, maybe a small wolf,

00:45:05.268 --> 00:45:06.870
and caribou.

00:45:06.903 --> 00:45:08.839 align:start size:84% position:16%
And, you know,
I'm looking for bears.

00:45:08.872 --> 00:45:11.508
There's a bear pushing
everybody around earlier.

00:45:11.541 --> 00:45:14.177
So, I think what I want to do.

00:45:14.210 --> 00:45:15.946
My daylight is fading.

00:45:15.979 --> 00:45:17.914
I'm gonna get back
to the Sue-craft.

00:45:17.947 --> 00:45:21.551 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don't want to be caught
out here at night because
then the tables have turned.

00:45:21.584 --> 00:45:23.754 align:start size:91% position:9%
