00:45:38.001 --> 00:45:40.504
If he's a problem, if
he's absolutely rogue,

00:45:40.537 --> 00:45:44.208 align:start size:88% position:13%
he'll visit me and
I'll deal with it then.

00:45:50.380 --> 00:45:51.815
CHIP: Living, what
