00:45:56.352 --> 00:45:57.921
It's all good.

00:46:03.760 --> 00:46:05.629 align:start size:84% position:16%
Come on, Carol.
Let's have a look-see.

00:46:09.566 --> 00:46:11.802 align:start size:88% position:13% line:0%
