<i> harsh winter elements,</i>

00:46:27.483 --> 00:46:30.521 align:start size:97% position:3%
<i> Agnes, Idi, and Ting
 work on a caribou skin parka.</i>

00:46:31.721 --> 00:46:35.459 align:start size:91% position:9%
