She's been in, uh,
woodshop in school.

00:47:12.028 --> 00:47:14.164
She's had the basics down on
making these kinds of stuffs.

00:47:14.731 --> 00:47:17.634
She also saw me for years
doing it too, and, uh,
she'll be able to, someday,

00:47:17.667 --> 00:47:19.970
to do all this stuff herself.

00:47:20.470 --> 00:47:22.606
He's gonna love this
gift, isn't he Carol?

00:47:22.639 --> 00:47:23.673
CAROL: Uh-hmm.

00:47:23.706 --> 00:47:25.308
I'll probably get
to ride it, too.

00:47:25.341 --> 00:47:27.010
CHIP: Oh, I'm sure you will.

00:47:27.043 --> 00:47:29.146 align:start size:88% position:13%
He's gonna think we
made him the best little
toy in the world, I bet.

00:47:32.582 --> 00:47:35.052 align:start size:91% position:9%
Looking good.
Looking real good, Carol.

00:47:38.221 --> 00:47:39.789
You can see how these
