possibly can, and it'll,

00:47:50.867 --> 00:47:54.071 align:start size:91% position:9%
it'll give just a
little slight ever bit but
it won't let things break

00:47:54.570 --> 00:47:56.640 align:start size:88% position:13%
so energy kind of
