00:47:56.673 --> 00:47:59.142
And we'll tie this
whole thing together.

00:47:59.175 --> 00:48:00.811
We'll work from the
back forward, okay?

00:48:01.377 --> 00:48:03.180
CAROL: Yup.

00:48:05.415 --> 00:48:07.784 align:start size:97% position:3%
CHIP: People have been
