you know what I'm saying?

00:48:13.923 --> 00:48:16.326
So that's how I look at it.

00:48:16.993 --> 00:48:18.595
I wanna make the kid happy.

00:48:18.628 --> 00:48:22.633 align:start size:94% position:6%
If, uh, that sled is
beautiful in the eye of that
beholder, then I'll be glad.

00:48:23.232 --> 00:48:26.703
Wade can play with the thing,
